<title>UK: Soccer-Coventry's Daish fined.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Coventry's Daish fined.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry City defender Liam Daish was fined 500 pounds ($840) plus costs on Thursday for remarks made to a steward after an English premier league match against Chelsea in August.</p>
<p>The English Football Association's disciplinary commission said Daish was guilty of &quot;improper behaviour&quot; when he confronted the steward in the players' tunnel after being sent off.</p>
<p>Republic of Ireland international Daish declined to comment after the hearing.</p>
